  "description": "Unique heavy-duty folding bike\n\nThe Forte is a groundbreaking heavy-duty folding bike. Built for those who require extra strength and stability, it's ideal for heavier riders or those carrying substantial loads. With an impressive load limit of 300 lbs, you can confidently use it for work commutes, adventurous camping trips, or whenever a sturdy frame is necessary.\n\nDesigned with quality components\n\nThis folding bike for heavy riders includes top-notch features like Shimano 8-speed components and reliable V-style brakes. The lightweight aluminum frame provides durability without sacrificing ease of use. Enhanced with front and rear fenders, a rear rack, and a wide comfort saddle, the Forte is as comfortable as it is robust.\n\nBuilt for safety and comfort\n\nTested rigorously to ensure reliability, this bike comes with SGS-CSTC safety approvals. Weighing only 28 lbs, its portability is unmatched for a high capacity bike load model. Ready for immediate adventure with a preassembled design, Forte offers a risk-free purchase with a 30-day money-back guarantee.",
